   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Role order: Sales planner sees section 2 \"From Operations\" first; Ops planner sees \"From Sales\" first; Approver sees the review strip and section 4 first; Pilot operator sees section 7\npromoted to the top right; view-only roles see sections 1-5 within scope, without actions, plus a line \"Read-only · scope: <scope>\".\nThere are no day windows and no \"Advance step\" button.",
   "originalText": "Role order: Sales planner sees section 2 \"From Operations\" first; Ops planner sees \"From Sales\" first; Approver sees the review strip and section 4 first; Pilot operator sees section 7\npromoted to the top right; view-only roles see sections 1-5 within scope, without actions, plus a line \"Read-only · scope: <scope>\".\nThere are no day windows and no \"Advance step\" button.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e119",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 973.0,
   "width": 1339.1999999999998,
   "height": 90.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
